    {
      "direction": "input",
      "name": "payload",
      "type_desc": "dict",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "required": true,
      "default_value_repr": "",
      "constraints": "Exact version-1 envelope with training, prediction, detector, classifier, hull, plan and config. Training entries carry numerical-transport frames, positional part in [0,49] and original index; prediction carries numerical-transport clips. Frames decode to uint8 RGB with four axes, final axis3 and spatial dimensions at least2; training clips are nonempty. Config requires record_order_seed in [0,2**32); optional n_splits in [1,50], positive batch_size, batches_per_epoch, test_every and frames_per_video, and precision float16/float32. Detector policy is random or supplied state with explicit seed. Classifier policy is random, encoder or complete per-run states. Hull requires a caller-supplied native predictor path, kept out of report fields. Runs and requests are explicit integer triples. Decoded uint8 RGB clips, explicit original/altered pair relationships and positional part groups. Labels derive from whether a clip references itself as its original. Both classes must occur in each selected training and validation population. Fold assignment partitions fifty positional groups and keeps each original and its alterations in the same fold. Originals must reference themselves directly. Full EfficientNet-B7 classifier with explicit random, encoder or complete state initialization. Runs specify seed, fold and epoch count; requests specify zero-based checkpoint epochs. Every requested run must be configured."
    },
    {
      "direction": "output",
      "name": "result",
      "type_desc": "dict",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "required": true,
      "default_value_repr": "",
      "constraints": "Version1 result mapping with explicit executable plan, training record count, per-run training/validation summaries and ordered predictions. Each prediction includes score, status, reason, selected frame count, classified face count, model count and precision. Inspect status: source_fallback score0.5 can indicate empty input, no faces or caught execution failure. No trained model or native predictor path is returned. Scores are not calibrated cross-domain probabilities."
    }
  ]
